#: src/onboarding.py:643
msgid "Setup lighting 1"
msgstr "Enstalasyon ekleraj 1"

#: src/onboarding.py:644
msgid "Setup lighting 2"
msgstr "Enstalasyon ekleraj 2"

#: src/onboarding.py:662
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Pa ka sove modèl figi"

#: src/onboarding.py:667 src/onboarding.py:714
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Eskane dezyèm modèl"

#: src/onboarding.py:673
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Pa t 'kapab anrejistre dezyèm modèl la"

#: src/onboarding.py:674
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must still "
"be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than turning it "
"off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Premye modèl ou a sove, kidonk koneksyon figi deja ap travay. Chanm nan dwe "
"toujou klere ase pou wè figi ou - chanje limyè a olye ke etenn li - Lè sa a, "
"eseye ankò, oswa sote epi ajoute yon modèl pita nan Anviwònman."

#: src/onboarding.py:708
msgid "Second scan: different lighting"
msgstr "Dezyèm eskanè: ekleraj diferan"

#: src/onboarding.py:710
msgid ""
"First model saved. Now change the light — for example turn a lamp on or off, "
"move away from the window, or use the other room light — keep your face "
"clearly visible, then press Scan again."
msgstr ""
"Premye modèl sove. Koulye a, chanje limyè a - pou egzanp limen oswa etenn "
"yon lanp, ale lwen fenèt la, oswa itilize limyè nan lòt chanm - kenbe figi "
"ou byen vizib, Lè sa a, peze Scan ankò."

#: src/onboarding.py:752
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware and tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ka debloke {} ou otomatikman lè l sèvi avèk otantifikasyon figi "
"(bous detekte: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Estati TPM:</b> Tcheke pyès ki nan konpitè ak zouti TPM..."

#: src/onboarding.py:772
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ka debloke {} ou otomatikman lè l sèvi avèk otantifikasyon figi "
"(bous detekte: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Estati TPM:</b> Materyèl TPM detekte. Enstale <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"otomatikman..."

#: src/onboarding.py:784
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active. Your password will be securely "
"sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ka debloke {} ou otomatikman lè l sèvi avèk otantifikasyon figi "
"(bous detekte: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Estati TPM:</b> Materyèl TPM 2.0 aktif. Modpas ou a pral byen sele "
"andedan TPM la."

#: src/onboarding.py:786
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, but automatic installation of "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Falling back to software-based credential caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ka debloke {} ou otomatikman lè l sèvi avèk otantifikasyon figi "
"(bous detekte: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Estati TPM:</b> TPM pyès ki nan konpitè detekte, men enstalasyon otomatik "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> echwe. Kouri <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Tonbe tounen nan lojisyèl ki baze sou kachèt kalifikasyon."

#: src/onboarding.py:788
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detected. Using software-based credential "
"caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ka debloke {} ou otomatikman lè l sèvi avèk otantifikasyon figi "
"(bous detekte: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Estati TPM:</b> Pa gen pyès ki nan konpitè TPM detekte. Sèvi ak kachèt "
"kalifikasyon ki baze sou lojisyèl (AES-256-GCM)."

