#: src/main.ui:73
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Snapshots nan figi ou ki Ubuntu Hello konpare ak. Kenbe omwen de, anrejistre "
"nan ekleraj diferan."

#: src/main.ui:95
