#: src/main.ui:135
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks to the "
"camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps (or in "
"daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to keep unlocking "
"reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Se sèlman yon modèl figi ki enskri. Ekleraj chanje fason figi ou gade nan "
"kamera a, kidonk yon sèl modèl ka echwe nan aswè a anba lanp (oswa nan "
"lajounen). Ajoute yon dezyèm modèl ki anrejistre nan diferan limyè pou kenbe "
"déblotché serye nenpòt ki lè nan jounen an."

#: src/main.ui:144
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Ajoute yon dezyèm modèl"

