#: src/main.ui:435
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, then "
"reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"Yon notifikasyon sou biwo a parèt pandan Ubuntu Hello kap chèche figi ou, "
"epi li rapòte rezilta a. Tantativ ki echwe yo rete nan lis notifikasyon an."

#: src/main.ui:466
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Montre notifikasyon"

#: src/main.ui:472
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr ""
"Yon kat pou chak tantativ otantifikasyon figi, mete ajou an plas ak rezilta "
"a."

#: src/main.ui:503
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Son notifikasyon"

#: src/main.ui:509
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Jwe son sistèm lan pou yon tantativ rekonèt oswa echwe."

#: src/main.ui:540
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Mete dyagnostik"

#: src/main.ui:546
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute modèl la, sètitid kont papòt, ankadreman, kamera ak distribisyon nan "
"chak kat. Li itil lè w rapòte yon pwoblèm."

#: src/main.ui:610 src/onboarding.ui:707
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Debloke"

#: src/main.ui:624
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Pèmèt otantifikasyon figi pou déblotché otomatikman keyring w la oswa "
"KWallet lè w konekte. Sa a sere modpas ou sele nan TPM a lè li disponib, "
"oswa ankode avèk AES-256-GCM lè l sèvi avèk yon kle prensipal rasin sèlman. "
"Ansanm otorizasyon figi PAM_AUTHTOK pou pam_gnome_keyring oswa pam_kwallet5 "
"selon Desktop ou."

